{"sha": "d4bba06a6054bce480b59b764724cba33de517d1e2cea31b66a57e9369791f00", "body": ["\\chapter{力的功}\\label{ch:g11:work-of-force}", "", "把衣柜推过房间，你就做了功；顶着墙推", "一整个下午，不论肌肉感觉如何，物理上都计为", "零。功是力沿\\emph{运动}所输送的能量——", "即传递中的能量（见\\cref{ch:g10:energy-conservation}），以焦耳计量。本章", "计算\\cref{ch:g11:forces-and-motion}中的力——", "斜向拉力、重力、摩擦力，并给出做功的快慢：功率。", "", "\\section{恒力的功}", "", "\\begin{definition}[恒力的功]\\label{def:g11:work-of-force:work}", "恒力 $\\vect F$ 作用于沿直线段", "从 $A$ 运动到 $B$ 的物体，所做的\\emph{功}\\index{功（力的）}为", "\\[", "W_{AB}(\\vect F) = F \\times AB \\times \\cos\\theta ,", "\\]", "其中 $F$ 为力的大小（单位为 \\unit{N}），$AB$ 为", "位移的长度（单位为 \\unit{m}），$\\theta$ 为", "$\\vect F$ 与 $\\vect{AB}$ 的夹角。功的单位是", "\\emph{焦耳}\\index{焦耳}（\\unit{J}）：一焦耳是一牛顿的力", "沿其自身方向移动一米所做的功。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{remark}\\label{rem:g11:work-of-force:scal}", "$F \\times AB \\times \\cos\\theta$ 恰是本学年数学教材中的", "数量积 $\\vect F \\cdot \\vect{AB}$。只有", "\\emph{沿}运动的分量 $F\\cos\\theta$ 才做功。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\draw (-0.4,0) -- (6.4,0);", "  \\draw[fill=omExo!15] (0.4,0) rectangle (1.5,0.7);", "  \\coordinate (P) at (0.95,0.35);", "  \\draw[dashed, omExo] ($(P)+(2.29,1.61)$) -- ($(P)+(2.29,0)$);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, very thick] (P) -- ($(P)+(35:2.8)$)", "    node[above] {$\\vect F$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omMeth, thick] (P) -- ++(2.29,0)", "    node[pos=0.75, below] {$F\\cos\\theta$};", "  \\draw (P) ++(1.1,0) arc[start angle=0, end angle=35, radius=1.1];", "  \\node at ($(P)+(17:1.38)$) {$\\theta$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (0.95,-0.7) -- (4.95,-0.7)", "    node[midway, below] {$\\vect{AB}$};", "  \\fill (0.95,-0.7) circle (1.2pt) node[below left] {$A$};", "  \\fill (4.95,-0.7) circle (1.2pt) node[below right] {$B$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 只有力在位移方向上的投影 $F\\cos\\theta$", "做功：$W_{AB}(\\vect F) = F \\times AB \\times \\cos\\theta$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[拖着的行李箱]\\label{ex:g11:work-of-force:suitcase}", "旅客在航站楼内拖着行李箱移动 \\qty{300}{m}，", "拉带受拉力 $F = \\qty{40}{N}$，与地面的夹角为 $\\theta = \\qty{50}{\\degree}$，", "则 $W = 40 \\times 300 \\times \\cos\\qty{50}{\\degree} \\approx", "\\qty{7.7}{kJ}$。若拉带水平（$\\theta = 0$），", "同样的力将做功 \\qty{12}{kJ}：约三分之一的拉力对前进毫无贡献。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{definition}[动力做功、阻力做功、零功]\\label{def:g11:work-of-force:sign}", "$\\cos\\theta$ 的符号把每个力分为三种情形：", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item $\\theta < \\qty{90}{\\degree}$：$W > 0$，此时的功是", "        \\emph{动力功}\\index{动力功}——力把能量输入", "        运动之中；", "  \\item $\\theta = \\qty{90}{\\degree}$：$W = 0$，力完全不做功，", "        无论它有多大；", "  \\item $\\theta > \\qty{90}{\\degree}$：$W < 0$，此时的功是", "        \\emph{阻力功}\\index{阻力功}——力消耗", "        能量。典型情形是 $\\qty{180}{\\degree}$ 的制动：", "        \\qty{800}{N} 的力作用\\qty{45}{m}，使汽车失去 $800 \\times 45 \\times (-1)", "        = \\qty{-36}{kJ}$ 的能量，转化为制动盘中的热量。", "\\end{itemize}", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\draw (0,0) -- (2.6,0); \\draw[fill=omExo!15] (0.9,0) rectangle (1.7,0.55);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, very thick] (1.3,0.28) -- ++(40:1.1)", "    node[above] {$\\vect F$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (0.5,-0.5) -- (2.1,-0.5);", "  \\node at (1.3,2.0) {$W > 0$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}\\qquad", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\draw (0,0) -- (2.6,0); \\draw[fill=omExo!15] (0.9,0) rectangle (1.7,0.55);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, very thick] (1.3,0.55) -- ++(90:1.1)", "    node[above] {$\\vect F$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (0.5,-0.5) -- (2.1,-0.5);", "  \\node at (1.3,2.0) {$W = 0$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}\\qquad", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\draw (0,0) -- (2.6,0); \\draw[fill=omExo!15] (0.9,0) rectangle (1.7,0.55);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, very thick] (1.3,0.28) -- ++(140:1.1)", "    node[above] {$\\vect F$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (0.5,-0.5) -- (2.1,-0.5);", "  \\node at (1.3,2.0) {$W < 0$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 三种情形——动力、零功、阻力——由", "力与位移（红色箭头）之间的夹角区分。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{重力的功}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[重力的功]\\label{prop:g11:work-of-force:weight}", "质量为 $m$ 的物体从 $A$（高度 $z_A$）运动到", "$B$（高度 $z_B$）时，沿\\emph{任意}由直线段组成的路径，", "其重力 $\\vect P$ 所做的功为", "\\[", "W_{AB}(\\vect P) = mg\\,(z_A - z_B) = \\pm\\, mgh ,", "\\]", "其中 $h = \\abs{z_A - z_B}$ 为高度下降量：下降时为 $+mgh$，", "上升时为 $-mgh$——功只取决于高度下降量，与路径无关。", "\\end{proposition}", ""]}